{
  "description": "Replayable, self-contained cases for the local member directory. Each case runs on its own fresh SQLite file under a virtual clock (start_at), so outcomes are deterministic. receipts.N is the receipt of ops[N]; assertions carry explicit expected values written from the task rules, never derived from the implementation.",
  "format": 1,
  "cases": [
